    "body": "## Problem\n\nThe [spec](https://contour-terminal.org/vt-extensions/color-palette-update-notifications/) for DEC mode 2031 says the terminal should send `CSI ? 997 ; Ps n` but nvim's terminal sends `CSI 997 ; Ps n`(missing `?`). Apps that parses the message strictly (opencode for example) ignore the message instead of properly switching theme because of that. \n\n## Solution\n\nSend \"CSI ? 997 ; Ps n\".",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-13T12:55:17Z",
